              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "acglock"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Worth tracking down the authentic ingredients! The taste is sweet, tangy, salty, and spicy! Unique! I salted the rim with black lava salt, but the Sangrita really makes it salty enough. Squirt is unique too... try to find it."
          },
          {
